# Requests against a local ride-service (the local profile with the compose stack).
# Runs in the IntelliJ HTTP client and in the VS Code REST Client.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@rider = local.user@example.com
# one booking: send the request below twice with this key and the second answer is the first one replayed
@key = 6f1c9f0a-2b3e-4a4b-9f0a-1234567890ab

### Book a ride
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rides
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{rider}}
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{
  "origin": {"lat": 52.5200066, "lon": 13.4049540},
  "target": {"lat": 52.3675734, "lon": 4.9041389},
  "client": {"appVersion": "4.2.0", "platform": "android"}
}

### Same key, another route: refused with 422
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rides
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{rider}}
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{
  "origin": {"lat": 52.5200066, "lon": 13.4049540},
  "target": {"lat": 48.8566140, "lon": 2.3522219}
}

### Missing Idempotency-Key: refused with 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rides
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{rider}}

{
  "origin": {"lat": 52.5200066, "lon": 13.4049540},
  "target": {"lat": 52.3675734, "lon": 4.9041389}
}

### Unknown user: refused with 401
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rides
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: nobody@example.com
Idempotency-Key: 0b6a5c7e-3f1d-4c2b-9a8e-2d4f6b8c0e1a

{
  "origin": {"lat": 52.5200066, "lon": 13.4049540},
  "target": {"lat": 52.3675734, "lon": 4.9041389}
}

### Invalid coordinates: refused with 400 naming every field
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rides
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{rider}}
Idempotency-Key: 9d8c7b6a-5f4e-4d3c-8b2a-1f0e9d8c7b6a

{
  "origin": {"lat": 91, "lon": -181}
}

### The API document
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs
